msgid ""
"On success, set *\\*digits* and return a writer. On error, set an exception "
"and return ``NULL``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0757.rst:184
msgid "*negative* is ``1`` if the number is negative, or ``0`` otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0757.rst:186
msgid ""
"*ndigits* is the number of digits in the *digits* array. It must be greater "
"than or equal to 0."
