#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0757.rst:189
msgid ""
"The caller can either initialize the array of digits *digits* and then call :"
"c:func:`PyLongWriter_Finish` to get a Python :class:`int`, or call :c:func:"
"`PyLongWriter_Discard` to destroy the writer instance.  Digits must be in "
"the range [``0``; ``(1 << sys.int_info.bits_per_digit) - 1``].  Unused "
"digits must be set to ``0``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0757.rst:196
